<view class="page"><view class="eyebrow">KNOW WHY YOU RUN</view><view class="title">有出处的训练知识</view><view class="subtitle">原书概括、工程规则和候选书目分别标记。</view>
  <view wx:if="{{metadata.projectLibraryLoaded}}" class="note">已连接同项目知识库：{{metadata.books}} 本书 · {{metadata.indexedPages}} 页索引 · {{metadata.importedCards}} 张扩展知识卡 · {{metadata.externalSources}} 篇补充资料。来源定位核对不等于专业人工审校。</view>
  <view wx:if="{{error}}" class="note danger">{{error}}</view>
  <view class="card"><view class="card-title">多轮知识对话</view><view class="muted">助手可以检索本地原书片段，并显示来源。配置 DeepSeek 后，可选择用模型解释；未配置时使用本地检索。</view><button class="primary" bindtap="agent">打开循跑知识助手</button></view>
  <view class="card"><view class="card-title">快速查知识卡</view><input class="input" value="{{query}}" bindinput="input" maxlength="300" placeholder="例如：疲劳时如何调整训练？"/><button class="secondary" bindtap="search">检索已核对的知识卡</button><view wx:if="{{answer}}" class="bullet" style="margin-top:22rpx;white-space:pre-wrap">{{answer}}</view><view wx:for="{{citations}}" wx:key="id" class="muted">依据：{{item.chapter}} · PDF 页序号 {{item.pdfPages}}</view></view>
  <view class="card" wx:for="{{cards}}" wx:key="id"><view class="badge">{{item.topic}} · {{item.evidence}}</view><view class="card-title" style="margin-top:18rpx">{{item.title}}</view><view class="bullet">{{item.summary}}</view><view wx:if="{{item.limits}}" class="note">条件与局限：{{item.limits}}</view><view class="muted">{{item.chapter}}</view><view wx:if="{{item.pdfPages.length}}" class="muted">PDF 页序号 {{item.pdfPages}}（不等于纸书页码）</view><view wx:for="{{item.citations}}" wx:for-item="reference" wx:key="sourceId" class="muted">{{reference.title}} · {{reference.readStatus}} · {{reference.pdfPages}}</view><view wx:if="{{item.url}}" class="link" data-url="{{item.url}}" bindtap="copyUrl">复制来源链接</view></view>
  <view class="card"><view class="card-title">知识库书目</view><view wx:for="{{sources}}" wx:key="id" class="line"><view>{{item.title}}</view><view class="muted">{{item.author}} · {{item.edition}}</view><view class="muted">{{item.status}} · {{item.scope}}</view><view wx:if="{{item.url}}" class="link" data-url="{{item.url}}" bindtap="copyUrl">复制书目链接</view></view><view class="note">已提供 PDF 仅用于本地研究。公开全文问答、分发与商业使用前需要确认相应内容许可。候选书目未参与自动处方。</view></view>
</view>
